ssageTitle":"Add EmergencyContact model class with tests","messageBody":"Add EmergencyContact field class (8-digit validation) to support the\nRegistering Students feature. Follows existing AB3 field patterns with\nimmutability, null checks, and validation. This replaces Phone as the\ncontact field for student records.\n\nMade-with: Cursor\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":60,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":63,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"24f5967228102625dbc2754f87b47f44472dc2f0","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #46 from randalliasdanx/feature/add-subject-paymentstatus-model","messageBody":"Add Subject and PaymentStatus model classes with tests","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"0699851cb720e1e5bc990f4d22c55a33d8758f62","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #47 from randalliasdanx/feature/add-emergency-contact-model","messageBody":"Add EmergencyContact model class with tests","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"f7bb332e69841f4edd742e6c8f7e2c3add861e80","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Replace Phone with EmergencyContact, add Subject and PaymentStatus to Person","messageBody":"Remove Phone field from Person model and replace with EmergencyContact\n(8-digit validation). Add Subject (Set-based, alphanumeric) and\nPaymentStatus (Paid/Due/Overdue) fields. Update all commands, parsers,\nstorage, UI, and tests to support new field structure.\n\nNew CLI prefixes: s/ (subject), ec/ (emergency contact), ps/ (payment status)\n\nMade-with: Cursor\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":468,"deletions":178},"test-code":{"insertions":1063,"deletions":557}}},{"hash":"dab2a9685c09d2c495dc6f95e44c19bcd2b12c29","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #49 from randalliasdanx/feature/integrate-new-fields-into-person","messageBody":"Replace Phone with EmergencyContact, add Subject and PaymentStatus to Person","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"